# Perft suite for the Quant UCI harness.
# Format: <FEN> ;D<depth> <nodes> ;D<depth> <nodes> ...
# A "# name" comment line names the position that follows it.
# Sources: Chess Programming Wiki "Perft Results" (positions 1-6) and the
# well-known tricky-position collection (illegal en passant, castling checks,
# promotions, stalemate). For the tricky positions only the deepest count is
# from the published collection; the shallower ones were filled in with
# harness/refgen.py after it reproduced every published count. Counts up to
# 5M nodes can be re-checked with refgen via `perft.py --verify-suite`.
# All 116 counts were independently recomputed with shakmaty 0.27.3 on
# 2026-10-17 (harness/oracle); rerun it before adding positions.

# startpos
rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1 ;D1 20 ;D2 400 ;D3 8902 ;D4 197281 ;D5 4865609 ;D6 119060324
# kiwipete
r3k2r/p1ppqpb1/bn2pnp1/3PN3/1p2P3/2N2Q1p/PPPBBPPP/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1 ;D1 48 ;D2 2039 ;D3 97862 ;D4 4085603 ;D5 193690690
# cpw-pos3 (rook endgame, pins, en passant)
8/2p5/3p4/KP5r/1R3p1k/8/4P1P1/8 w - - 0 1 ;D1 14 ;D2 191 ;D3 2812 ;D4 43238 ;D5 674624 ;D6 11030083 ;D7 178633661
# cpw-pos4 (promotions, castling rights)
r3k2r/Pppp1ppp/1b3nbN/nP6/BBP1P3/q4N2/Pp1P2PP/R2Q1RK1 w kq - 0 1 ;D1 6 ;D2 264 ;D3 9467 ;D4 422333 ;D5 15833292
# cpw-pos4-mirrored
r2q1rk1/pP1p2pp/Q4n2/bbp1p3/Np6/1B3NBn/pPPP1PPP/R3K2R b KQ - 0 1 ;D1 6 ;D2 264 ;D3 9467 ;D4 422333 ;D5 15833292
# cpw-pos5
rnbq1k1r/pp1Pbppp/2p5/8/2B5/8/PPP1NnPP/RNBQK2R w KQ - 1 8 ;D1 44 ;D2 1486 ;D3 62379 ;D4 2103487 ;D5 89941194
# cpw-pos6
r4rk1/1pp1qppp/p1np1n2/2b1p1B1/2B1P1b1/P1NP1N2/1PP1QPPP/R4RK1 w - - 0 10 ;D1 46 ;D2 2079 ;D3 89890 ;D4 3894594 ;D5 164075551
# illegal-ep-1 (ep would expose king on the rank)
3k4/3p4/8/K1P4r/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1 ;D1 18 ;D2 92 ;D3 1670 ;D4 10138 ;D5 185429 ;D6 1134888
# illegal-ep-2 (ep pawn pinned diagonally)
8/8/4k3/8/2p5/8/B2P2K1/8 w - - 0 1 ;D1 13 ;D2 102 ;D3 1266 ;D4 10276 ;D5 135655 ;D6 1015133
# ep-capture-gives-check
8/8/1k6/2b5/2pP4/8/5K2/8 b - d3 0 1 ;D1 15 ;D2 126 ;D3 1928 ;D4 13931 ;D5 206379 ;D6 1440467
# short-castle-gives-check
5k2/8/8/8/8/8/8/4K2R w K - 0 1 ;D1 15 ;D2 66 ;D3 1198 ;D4 6399 ;D5 120330 ;D6 661072
# long-castle-gives-check
3k4/8/8/8/8/8/8/R3K3 w Q - 0 1 ;D1 16 ;D2 71 ;D3 1286 ;D4 7418 ;D5 141077 ;D6 803711
# castle-rights
r3k2r/1b4bq/8/8/8/8/7B/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1 ;D1 26 ;D2 1141 ;D3 27826 ;D4 1274206
# castling-prevented
r3k2r/8/3Q4/8/8/5q2/8/R3K2R b KQkq - 0 1 ;D1 44 ;D2 1494 ;D3 50509 ;D4 1720476
# promote-out-of-check
2K2r2/4P3/8/8/8/8/8/3k4 w - - 0 1 ;D1 11 ;D2 133 ;D3 1442 ;D4 19174 ;D5 266199 ;D6 3821001
# discovered-check
8/8/1P2K3/8/2n5/1q6/8/5k2 b - - 0 1 ;D1 29 ;D2 165 ;D3 5160 ;D4 31961 ;D5 1004658
# promote-to-give-check
4k3/1P6/8/8/8/8/K7/8 w - - 0 1 ;D1 9 ;D2 40 ;D3 472 ;D4 2661 ;D5 38983 ;D6 217342
# underpromote-to-give-check
8/P1k5/K7/8/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1 ;D1 6 ;D2 27 ;D3 273 ;D4 1329 ;D5 18135 ;D6 92683
# self-stalemate
K1k5/8/P7/8/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1 ;D1 2 ;D2 6 ;D3 13 ;D4 63 ;D5 382 ;D6 2217
